"P2543877880" "I'll give you some Inspirations to experiment with, a Damage one and a Healing one. Just click on them in your Inspiration Tray to use them.<br><br>You can 'detach' any window by clicking the detach button in the upper or lower left corner of the window. This will allow you to place it anywhere in the interface that feels comfortable for you.<br><br><img src=COH_ToolbarDetach.tga><br><br>I want you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>take down four more thugs</A> while our detectives try to get to the bottom of this."
// AcceptString :
"P461175433" "Click here to receive your Inspirations and accept the task"
