"P2492462210" "Good job on those thugs. As a reward, I'll give you something called an <color lightblue>Enhancement</color>. You can use Enhancements to permanently improve a power. Click on the Enhancements tab on your Powers Tray to see Enhancements you have collected.<br><br><img src=COH_ToolbarEnhancementTray.tga><br><br>In that display, click the Manage option to get to the management screen where you can pick the power the Enhancement will be attached to.<br><br><img src=COH_ToolbarEnhancementTray.tga><br><br>You can use any of the 'Training' enhancements you find, but other types of Enhancements can only be used by specific origins. Just right click on an Enhancement to get more info about it. You should now go read more about Enhancements on the terminal over there, it will explain levels and combining Enhancements to make them more powerful."

