"P1529019077" "I'll give you some Inspirations to experiment with, a Damage one and a Healing one. Just click on them in your Inspiration Tray to use them. I want you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>take down four more thugs</A> while our detectives try to get to the bottom of this."

