"P1787702245" "Good job on those thugs. As a reward, I'll give you something called an Enhancement. You can use Enhancements to permanently improve a power. Click on the Enhancements tab on your Powers Tray to get to the management screen where you can pick the power the Enhancement will be attached to.<br><br><img src=Tut_Menu_Enhancements.tga><br><br>You can use any of the 'Training' enhancements you find, but other types of Enhancements can only be used by specific origins. Just right click on an Enhancement to get more info about it. Refer to your game manual to learn more about Enhancements, including how to combine them to make them stronger."
